<title>USA: Connecticut Energy sets marketing alliance.</title>
<headline>Connecticut Energy sets marketing alliance.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNE Energy Services Group Inc said Monday it has formed a marketing alliance with Standard Oil of Connecticut.</p>
<p>CNE said the two companies will jointly market natural gas and petroleum products to commercial, industrial and municipal customers throughout Connecticut.</p>
<p>CNE Energy is a n unregulated subsidiary of Connecticut Energy Corp, a holding company primarily engaged in the retail distribution of natural gas through its regulated subsidiary, The Southern Connecticut Gas Company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
